      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "filter-segment-selected",
      "description": "Filtro de la lista en pill con conteos en mono; aria-pressed en cada segmento.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filtrar teléfonos\"><button class=\"ds-seg-btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Todos <span class=\"ds-n\">4</span></button><button class=\"ds-seg-btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Pendientes <span class=\"ds-n\">0</span></button><button class=\"ds-seg-btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\">En sesión <span class=\"ds-n\">1</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seg{display:inline-flex;gap:4px;padding:4px;border-radius:9999px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:color-mix(in oklch,var(--card) 60%,transparent);} .ds-seg-btn{font-family:'Geist Variable',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:32px;padding:0 12px;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted-foreground);font-size:.875rem;cursor:pointer;transition:color .15s,background-color .15s;} .ds-seg-btn:hover{color:var(--foreground);} .ds-seg-btn[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--foreground);color:var(--background);} .ds-seg-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:2px;} .ds-n{font-family:'Geist Mono Variable',ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:.75rem;opacity:.7;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Fila de teléfono resaltada",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "device-row-highlighted",
      "description": "Fila de la lista con columnas fijas, resaltada tras un cambio de estado hasta que se ve.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-row\"><span class=\"ds-row-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-row-name\"><span class=\"ds-t\">Participante 3</span><span class=\"ds-mono\">2312DRA50G, Android 16</span></span><span class=\"ds-chip-live2\">En sesión</span><span class=\"ds-num\">2,6 s<small>ping</small></span><span class=\"ds-num\">5 min<small>hoy</small></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-row{font-family:'Geist Variable',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) 9rem 4.5rem 6.5rem;align-items:center;column-gap:16px;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid color-mix(in oklch,var(--signal) 50%,transparent);background:var(--signal-soft);box-shadow:0 10px 30px -18px var(--signal);color:var(--foreground);transition:background-color .5s,border-color .5s,box-shadow .5s;} .ds-row-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid color-mix(in oklch,var(--signal) 40%,transparent);background:var(--signal-soft);color:var(--signal);} .ds-row-name{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;} .ds-t{font-weight:500;} .ds-mono{font-family:'Geist Mono Variable',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted-foreground);} .ds-chip-live2{justify-self:start;height:24px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:0 10px;border-radius:9999px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:500;background:var(--signal-soft);color:var(--signal);} .ds-num{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;font-family:'Geist Mono Variable',ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:.875rem;} .ds-num small{font-family:'Geist Variable',sans-serif;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted-foreground);}"
    },
